# WHEELTEC H30 on the CH9102 USB-UART (1a86:55d4).
# The serial number pins the IMU independently of /dev/ttyACM0 vs ttyUSB0 and
# keeps it separate from the LSLIDAR M10 (1a86:7523).
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1a86", ATTRS{idProduct}=="55d4", ATTRS{serial}=="5C2C063393", SYMLINK+="EPRobot_imu", MODE="0666", GROUP="dialout"

